      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Price Ranges per Cubic Meter</h2>

      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Gabion pricing is quoted per cubic meter of basket volume (or per ton — convert carefully, and compare on weight as described above). These are realistic FOB China ranges for standard baskets (1–3 m lengths, 0.5–1 m heights) in full container quantities:
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-theme-card border-b border-theme">
              <th class="text-left p-3 text-theme-primary font-semibold">Specification</th>
